OL,3,AAndy Taylor: Duran Duran's livewire
OL,4,Aguitarist who was a Wild Boy on stage
OL,5,Aand off
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Taylor, who has died aged 65, was
OL,8,Fthe wild boy of Duran Duran.
OL,10,FIn the early 1980s, the pop legends
OL,11,Fsold over 100 million records and
OL,12,Fdominated the charts in both Britain
OL,13,Fand the United States.
OL,15,FBut success came at a cost. For Taylor,
OL,16,Fglobal superstardom became a cocaine
OL,17,Fand alcohol fuelled nightmare that left
OL,18,Fhim burnt out and battling clinical
OL,19,Fdepression.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
