OL,3,AAndy Taylor: Duran Duran's livewire
OL,4,Aguitarist who was a Wild Boy on stage
OL,5,Aand off
OL,6,
OL,7,F"For sure, we paraded around in our
OL,8,Ffast cars with beautiful models on
OL,9,Fyachts in the south of France without
OL,10,Fneeding to pay the bill," he later
OL,11,Fwrote.
